    "Cross-validation splits cells stratified by label, no animal holdout. AUC is separability/priority, not animal-level effect size or causality.",
    "23July2020 correction concerns PDF ExtendedData1–8 being replaced by3–10; use corrected main figures and verify ED numbering before future ED7b pairing.",
